{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南山律祖原本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現事或應作理事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂身口意此三能起業也自作教他見作隨喜此三能成業也現報生報後報此三名業果也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂長時無間恭敬無餘也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂行住食息常爾一心也"}
